Project Handoff Document — Sankalp Voice Agent
This document captures the progress made so far, how the system works, what is already implemented, and the architecture that is currently valid for continuation.

1. Project Goal
This project is an AI-powered outbound lead qualification and voice-calling system.

The platform is designed to:

capture new leads from a website form
validate and store them in PostgreSQL
enqueue outbound call jobs without Redis
call leads via Twilio
connect the call to an ElevenLabs voice agent
use an LLM to reason about the conversation
qualify the lead using BANT-style scoring
schedule callback logic when needed
display telemetry and lead activity in a live dashboard
The goal is not just a basic calling bot. It is intended to function as a full outbound sales qualification engine with live monitoring, callbacks, transcripts, scoring, and admin visibility.

